				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "W3tj9fZsQi6fVEAl8Xy7DA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "# Deployments\n\nA deployment is a GemStone stone managed by bvc.\n\nUse deployment language in project docs and command output. GemStone still exists underneath, but the user-level concept is deployment.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "IMKj4Xg4Sm2V/YrT/pC1gg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Create or start\n\n```sh\nbvc start myproject-dev\n```\n\nIf the deployment exists, bvc starts it.\n\nIf it does not exist, bvc installs it first, then starts it.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "BGHvQ8zoRyC1j90G2qVNbA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Temporary Seaside install\n\n```sh\nbvc start myproject-dev --with-seaside\n```\n\nThis is a temporary bridge while GemStone updates their server support.\n\nThe flag only matters when the deployment is first created. Once the deployment exists, it is already installed and the flag has nothing more to do.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "b3oyVB82TXG9Z5gmX3ZZTg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## List deployments\n\n```sh\nbvc list\n```\n\nThis reads the configured GsDevKit registry and lists registered deployments. It also runs:\n\n```sh\ngslist.solo -lc\n```\n\nto show running stones.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "sEi6+OLDRUODcxHnnABO+w=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Stop and delete\n\n```sh\nbvc stop myproject-dev\n```\n\nStops the deployment.\n\n```sh\nbvc delete myproject-dev\n```\n\nDeletes the deployment and its data. bvc asks for confirmation.\n\n```sh\nbvc delete myproject-dev --force\n```\n\nDeletes without asking.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "1Jox7ZbkS0uqBDG0lLhufQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## DevKit connectors\n\nbvc keeps the GT connector file up to date:\n\n```text\ndevkit/pharo-local/lepiter/gt4gemstone.properties\n```\n\nThe file represents all registered deployments, even when they are not running. It is refreshed when the DevKit is built or launched, and when deployments are created or deleted.\n"
			}
		]
	},
